WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Interviewer: Thanks for joining. Can you walk me through your first login experience?

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Participant: Sure. So when I first logged in, I saw the dashboard but I couldn't find the settings page. I kept clicking on different tabs trying to find it.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Interviewer: What did you expect to see when you logged in?

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Participant: I expected something like a setup wizard, you know? Instead I got dropped into this big dashboard with numbers everywhere. I honestly just Googled how to set things up.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Interviewer: Was there a moment where you felt stuck?

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Participant: Definitely. When I tried to export my data, there was no obvious button for it. I ended up asking a colleague because I didn't think there was help in the app.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Interviewer: Tell me about how you discovered new features over time.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Participant: Mostly by accident. I'd click something and find a new page. It sort of reminded me of how my bank app works — things are hidden behind menus you wouldn't think to check.
